[kanalyzer eval patch] applied after icall-sites.patch and resolution-rule.patch.
1. GPG: record the indirect calls that GPGAnalysisEngine::addFallbackIndirectTargets
   fills (empty after the points-to fixpoint -> every address-taken,
   signature-compatible function); exposed as fallbackIndirectCalls().
   No analysis change.
2. lotus-alias-call-graph: -cg-type=aserpta-origin (AserPTA with KOrigin<1>
   and the origin rule of lotus-alias-aser-aa.cpp).

diff -ruN a/include/Alias/InclusionBased/GPG/Analysis.h b/include/Alias/InclusionBased/GPG/Analysis.h
--- a/include/Alias/InclusionBased/GPG/Analysis.h	2026-09-27 20:27:07.962941826 -0700
